{
  "labs": [
    {
      "lesson": "ccna-u02-l5",
      "title": "Konfigurasi awal router dan switch",
      "minutes": 25,
      "tool": "packet-tracer",
      "goal": "Memberi router ISR4331 dan switch 2960 konfigurasi awal yang aman lewat kabel console, lalu menyimpannya dan membuktikan konfigurasi bertahan setelah reload.",
      "topology": {
        "devices": [
          {
            "id": "pc",
            "kind": "pc",
            "label": "PC0",
            "x": 2,
            "y": 0,
            "note": "terminal console"
          },
          {
            "id": "r1",
            "kind": "router",
            "label": "HQ-R1",
            "x": 0,
            "y": 1,
            "note": "ISR4331"
          },
          {
            "id": "sw1",
            "kind": "switch",
            "label": "HQ-SW1",
            "x": 4,
            "y": 1,
            "note": "2960-24TT"
          }
        ],
        "links": [
          {
            "from": "pc",
            "to": "r1",
            "toPort": "Console",
            "style": "dashed"
          },
          {
            "from": "pc",
            "to": "sw1",
            "toPort": "Console",
            "style": "dashed"
          }
        ]
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "text": "Letakkan router ISR4331, switch 2960-24TT, dan satu PC. Sambungkan kabel console (biru muda) dari PC ke port Console router. Untuk switch, pindahkan kabel yang sama setelah router selesai, atau pakai PC kedua."
        },
        {
          "text": "Di PC, buka Desktop lalu Terminal, dan pastikan pengaturannya 9600 bps, 8 data bit, tanpa parity, 1 stop bit, tanpa flow control. Kalau muncul pertanyaan initial configuration dialog, jawab no."
        },
        {
          "text": "Beri nama router dan enable secret.",
          "device": "HQ-R1",
          "commands": [
            "enable",
            "configure terminal",
            "hostname HQ-R1",
            "enable secret Cisc0Lab"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pasang password dan login di console serta lima line vty pertama.",
          "device": "HQ-R1",
          "commands": [
            "line console 0",
            "password Konsol1",
            "login",
            "exit",
            "line vty 0 4",
            "password Remote1",
            "login",
            "exit"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tambahkan banner, sandikan password teks biasa, lalu simpan. Tekan Enter saat ditanya nama tujuan.",
          "device": "HQ-R1",
          "commands": [
            "banner motd #Akses terbatas#",
            "service password-encryption",
            "end",
            "copy running-config startup-config",
            ""
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ulangi di switch dengan nama HQ-SW1. Switch 2960 punya 16 line vty, jadi pakai line vty 0 15.",
          "device": "HQ-SW1",
          "commands": [
            "enable",
            "configure terminal",
            "hostname HQ-SW1",
            "enable secret Cisc0Lab",
            "line vty 0 15",
            "password Remote1",
            "login",
            "end",
            "write memory"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        {
          "text": "Lihat konfigurasi yang tersimpan di router.",
          "device": "HQ-R1",
          "command": "show startup-config",
          "expect": "Ada hostname HQ-R1, enable secret dalam bentuk hash, password line yang diawali angka 7, dan banner motd."
        },
        {
          "text": "Buktikan konfigurasi bertahan: jalankan reload di privileged EXEC, konfirmasi, lalu tunggu router menyala lagi.",
          "expect": "Banner Akses terbatas muncul, console menanyakan password, dan prompt kembali menjadi HQ-R1>."
        },
        {
          "text": "Coba masuk privileged EXEC.",
          "device": "HQ-R1",
          "command": "enable",
          "expect": "IOS menanyakan Password, dan hanya Cisc0Lab yang diterima."
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "Packet Tracer dan IOS XE asli sama-sama menanyakan initial configuration dialog saat startup-config kosong. Jawab no untuk masuk CLI (Command-Line Interface) biasa.",
        "Di IOS XE asli, enable secret biasanya tampil sebagai type 9 (scrypt). Packet Tracer bisa menampilkan tipe lain. Yang penting: tidak terbaca sebagai teks biasa.",
        "Perintah reload tidak ada di simulator Langit, jadi langkah pembuktian ini hanya bisa dicoba di Packet Tracer atau perangkat asli."
      ],
      "sources": [
        "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/td/docs/routers/ios/config/17-x/syst-mgmt/b-system-management/m_cf-cli-basics.html",
        "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/td/docs/ios-xml/ios/sec_usr_cfg/configuration/15-mt/sec-usr-cfg-15-mt-book/sec-cfg-sec-4cli.html",
        "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/td/docs/switches/lan/catalyst9400/software/release/16-8/configuration_guide/sec/b_168_sec_9400_cg/controlling_switch_access_with_passwords_and_privilege_levels.html",
        "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/td/docs/ios-xml/ios/fundamentals/command/cf_command_ref/A_through_B.html",
        "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/td/docs/switches/lan/catalyst3850/software/release/16-9/configuration_guide/sys_mgmt/b_169_sys_mgmt_3850_cg/m-169-fm-config-cg.html",
        "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/support/docs/storage-networking/management/217970-troubleshoot-and-apply-correct-terminal.html"
      ]
    },
    {
      "lesson": "ccna-u03-l5",
      "title": "Menemukan dan memperbaiki masalah interface",
      "minutes": 25,
      "tool": "packet-tracer",
      "goal": "Menyalakan interface router yang mati, lalu membuat dan memperbaiki speed dan duplex yang tidak cocok antara switch dan PC.",
      "topology": {
        "devices": [
          {
            "id": "r1",
            "kind": "router",
            "label": "R1",
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "note": "ISR4331"
          },
          {
            "id": "sw1",
            "kind": "switch",
            "label": "SW1",
            "x": 2,
            "y": 1,
            "note": "2960-24TT"
          },
          {
            "id": "pc1",
            "kind": "pc",
            "label": "PC1",
            "x": 4,
            "y": 1
          },
          {
            "id": "pc2",
            "kind": "pc",
            "label": "PC2",
            "x": 2,
            "y": 2
          }
        ],
        "links": [
          {
            "from": "r1",
            "to": "sw1",
            "fromPort": "G0/0/0",
            "toPort": "G0/1"
          },
          {
            "from": "sw1",
            "to": "pc1",
            "fromPort": "Fa0/1"
          },
          {
            "from": "sw1",
            "to": "pc2",
            "fromPort": "Fa0/2"
          }
        ]
      },
      "addressing": [
        {
          "device": "R1",
          "port": "G0/0/0",
          "address": "192.168.10.1/24"
        },
        {
          "device": "PC1",
          "port": "NIC",
          "address": "192.168.10.11/24, gateway .1"
        },
        {
          "device": "PC2",
          "port": "NIC",
          "address": "192.168.10.12/24, gateway .1"
        }
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "text": "Sambungkan perangkat dengan kabel Copper Straight-Through sesuai topologi, lalu isi alamat IP (Internet Protocol) PC1 dan PC2 lewat Desktop > IP Configuration."
        },
        {
          "text": "Beri alamat ke interface router. Perhatikan status port sebelum dan sesudah no shutdown.",
          "device": "R1",
          "commands": [
            "enable",
            "configure terminal",
            "interface g0/0/0",
            "ip address 192.168.10.1 255.255.255.0",
            "no shutdown",
            "end",
            "show ip interface brief"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buat masalah dengan sengaja: set Fa0/1 manual ke 100 dan full, lalu di PC1 buka Config > FastEthernet0 dan biarkan Auto.",
          "device": "SW1",
          "commands": [
            "enable",
            "configure terminal",
            "interface fa0/1",
            "speed 100",
            "duplex full",
            "end"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lihat status dan setelan semua port.",
          "device": "SW1",
          "commands": [
            "show interfaces status"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Perbaiki dengan mengembalikan port ke autonegotiation, lalu simpan.",
          "device": "SW1",
          "commands": [
            "configure terminal",
            "interface fa0/1",
            "speed auto",
            "duplex auto",
            "end",
            "write memory"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        {
          "text": "Status interface router.",
          "device": "R1",
          "command": "show ip interface brief",
          "expect": "GigabitEthernet0/0/0 berstatus up dan protocol up dengan alamat 192.168.10.1."
        },
        {
          "text": "Setelah perbaikan, setelan port switch.",
          "device": "SW1",
          "command": "show interfaces status",
          "expect": "Fa0/1 connected dengan a-full dan a-100, tanda bahwa nilainya hasil autonegotiation."
        },
        {
          "text": "Uji dari PC1: ping 192.168.10.1 di Command Prompt.",
          "expect": "Ping berhasil tanpa timeout."
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "Packet Tracer tidak meniru counter error fisik seperti CRC (cyclic redundancy check) dan late collision secara lengkap, jadi gejala duplex mismatch mungkin tidak terlihat. Yang bisa dipelajari di sini: setelan speed dan duplex serta cara membacanya di show interfaces status.",
        "Di Packet Tracer, kabel salah jenis (crossover antara switch dan PC) bisa membuat link mati kalau auto-MDIX (automatic medium-dependent interface crossover) tidak berlaku pada port itu. Coba ganti jenis kabel dan lihat hasilnya."
      ],
      "sources": [
        "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/support/docs/switches/catalyst-6500-series-switches/12027-53.html",
        "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/td/docs/switches/lan/catalyst2960/software/release/15-2_2_e/configuration/guide/b_1522e_2960_2960c_2960s_2960sf_2960p_cg/b_1522e_2960_2960c_2960s_2960sf_2960p_cg_chapter_01000.html",
        "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/support/docs/switches/catalyst-6500-series-switches/17053-46.html",
        "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/td/docs/switches/lan/catalyst3650/hardware/installation/guide/Cat3650hig_book/HIGCABLE.html"
      ]
    },
    {
      "lesson": "ccna-u04-l8",
